<li><span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="37042cdb90ebde28">父母<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>fu6mou5</strong><br/>parents / father and mother</span></span>: parents</li>
<li><span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="85bf74961e252a34">阿哥<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>aa3go1</strong><br/>older brother</span></span>: older brother</li>
