</ul>
<p>Using the possessive particle
<span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="6ddec4a1f3da9adc">嘅<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>ge3</strong><br/>possessive particle / nominalizing particle / final assertive particle</span></span>,
you can introduce your family members. You can also use
