    "html": "<hr>
<h2>3. Negation &amp; A-not-A Questions</h2>
<h3>Negating with <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="bbf6e0d4fab7734b">唔<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>m4</strong><br/>not</span></span></h3>
<p>To negate <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="cfcbbb219389def4">係<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>hai6</strong><br/>to be (am/is/are) / yes</span></span>, place the negative adverb
<span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="bbf6e0d4fab7734b">唔<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>m4</strong><br/>not / no (negative prefix)</span></span> directly before it, forming
<span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="bbf6e0d4fab7734b">唔<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>m4</strong><br/>not / no (negative prefix)</span></span> <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="cfcbbb219389def4">係<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>hai6</strong><br/>to be (am/is/are) / yes</span></span> (&quot;is not
/ are not&quot;):</p>
",
    "type": "prose",
  },
  {
    "html": "<span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="b70bb4acc0484cf0">我<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>ngo5</strong><br/>I / me</span></span> <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="bbf6e0d4fab7734b">唔<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>m4</strong><br/>not / no (negative prefix)</span></span> <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="cfcbbb219389def4">係<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>hai6</strong><br/>to be (am/is/are) / yes</span></span> <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="6c2a9e197403c693">美國<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>mei5gwok3</strong><br/>United States / America</span></span> <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="50f5d65d57290f75">人<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>jan4</strong><br/>person / people / human</span></span>。
===
I am not American.",
    "type": "cantonese",
  },
  {
    "html": "",
    "type": "prose",
  },
  {
    "html": "<span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="7379f21b80edca33">佢<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>keoi5</strong><br/>he / she / it</span></span> <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="bbf6e0d4fab7734b">唔<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>m4</strong><br/>not / no (negative prefix)</span></span> <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="cfcbbb219389def4">係<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>hai6</strong><br/>to be (am/is/are) / yes</span></span> <span class="vocab-term" data-audio-hash="9e02b2c0025ab478">靚仔<span class="tooltip-popover"><strong>leng3zai2</strong><br/>handsome boy / handsome man / handsome</span></span>。
